senses.gloss:
सं-√ लक्ष् P. Ā. -लक्षयति, ˚ते, to distinguish by a mark, characterize, mark distinctly (see ˚लक्षित below);
to observe, see, perceive, feel, hear, learn, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to test, prove, try, ib. :
Pass. -लक्ष्यते, to be marked or observed or perceived, appear, ib.

सं-√ लभ् Ā. -लभते, to take hold of one another, seize or lay hold of mutually, TBr.;
to wrestle with (instr.), MaitrS.;
to obtain, receive, BhP. :
Desid. See लिप्सु below.

सं-√ लिख् P. -लिखति, to scratch, scarify, Suśr.;
to write, engrave, inscribe, Pañcar.;
to touch, strike, play upon (a musical instrument), Lāṭy.

सं-√ ली Ā. -लीयते, to cling or adhere to (acc.), MBh.;
to go into, find room in (loc.), ib.;
to lie down, hide, cower, lurk, be concealed, ib.; R.;
to melt away, ib.

सं-√ लुड् Caus. -लोडयति, to stir about, move to and fro, MBh.;
to disarrange, disturb, throw into disorder or confusion, ib. :
Pass. -लोड्यते, to be disturbed or destroyed, ib.

सं-√ लुभ् P. -लुभ्यति, to be perplexed or disturbed, fall into confusion, ŚBr. :
Caus. लोभयति, to disarrange, throw into confusion, mix up, Lāṭy.;
to efface, obliterate, AV.;
to allure, entice, seduce, MBh.; R.
